# Build context hygiene — keeps the image small and cache stable.

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/logs
.git
.gitignore
.github
docs
*.md
LICENSE
docker-data
.dockerignore
Dockerfile.dev
docker-compose*.yml
railway.toml
coverage
.coverage
htmlcov
**/*.egg-info
**/build
